{title: Kinna Sona Tenu}
{artist: Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Kinna [Bm]sona tenu rab ne ba [E7]naya [Bm],        Kinna [Bm]sona tenu rab ne ba [E7]naya [Bm]
Dil kare [E7]vekhada ra [E]va,        Kinna [Bm]sona tenu rab ne ba [E]naya
Dil [Bm]mudada ni [E]lakh sama [B]jaya,        [Bm]Dil kare [E7]vekhada ra [E]va
[Bm]Dil vich [E]tera [Bm]pyar va [E]sa ke,        [Bm]Ve ki jaa [A]va [Bm]kaur bitha ke
Tenu [Bm]dil vade sheeshe te sa [E7]jaya [Bm],        Dil kare [E7]vekhada ra [E]va
Kinna [Bm]sona tenu rab ne ba [E]naya,        [Bm]Pyar te [E]ra eh [Bm]zindagi [E]meri
[Bm]Kardi [A]hai main [Bm]pooja teri,        Tenu [Bm]ankhiya de piche me va [E7]saya [Bm]
Tenu [Bm]ankhiya de piche me va [E7]saya [Bm],        Dil kare [E7]vekhada ra [E]va
Kinna [Bm]sona tenu rab ne ba [E]naya
